  "synopsis": "**The Good, the Bad and the Deadly!**\nTobias Beckett taught Han Solo everything he knows about surviving hoodlum-filled cantinas and backwater worlds. But who is this career outlaw and why is Enfys Nest, one of the galaxy's most dangerous and brutal marauders, so dead set on taking him down once and for all? Find out in this original tale of a man who has gamed star system after star system, but at a cost that no heist can make up for.",
